# ExpiTrack Project Rules

## Technologies
- Next.js 14 (Pages Router, NOT App Router)
- TypeScript strong typing
- Tailwind CSS v4 (core style)
- Prisma ORM + SQLite
- NextAuth.js for authentication

## Design Requirements
- Use ONLY Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui (DO NOT use React Spectrum)
- Build all new components with Tailwind
- Color scheme: emerald for primary, slate for neutrals
- Support dark theme (dark: classes)
- Responsiveness is mandatory (mobile-first)

## Code Style
- Components in separate files with `.tsx`
- Use functional components
- Imports: React, then external libraries, then local ones
- Write TypeScript interfaces for props

## Prohibited
- DO NOT use Adobe React Spectrum (we're moving away from it)
- DO NOT use the "any" type
- DO NOT create components directly in page files

## Project Features
- Product statuses: ACTIVE, CONSUMED, DISCARDED
- Expiration date: calculated from the production date + expiration date (days/weeks/months)
- Status colors: EXPIRED=red, URGENT=orange, WARNING=yellow, SAFE=green